<title>SOUTH AFRICA: COPI raises yr share, div.</title>
<headline>COPI raises yr share, div.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30 1996</p>
<p>		 (million Canadian dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     202     vs    181</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  70     vs     65</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    35.53  vs     31.82</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    38.67  vs     34.71</p>
<p>    Tax			   3.13  vs	2.89</p>
<p>    Turnover		  180.65  vs    159.91</p>
<p>Div payable: December 6</p>
<p>On register: November 15</p>
<p>Full name: Canadian Overseas Packaging Industries Ltd (paper and packaging)</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
